# Xiao Furina Ororon Xianyun. ~22s Rot. Xiao Taser with Furina. 11 plunges. VV > MH Xiao >= LNO + VV Xianyun. OHC > SoDP Xianyun, but Clam bubbles may miss. 11 plunges; 50% Collisions.

